. * Stata 18 tabulate, summarize() oracle. Run from this directory:
. * /Applications/Stata/StataMP.app/Contents/MacOS/stata-mp -bq do tabulate-sum
> mary.do
. set more off

. set linesize 80

. clear

. input g h double y double w

             g          h           y           w
  1. 1 1 10 1
  2. 1 1 20 2
  3. 1 2 40 3
  4. 2 1 50 4
  5. 2 2 . 2
  6. 3 2 . 1
  7. . 1 60 1
  8. end

